body:
The code that triggers the save is as follows:

``` php
class ManufacturersController extends \App\Controller\AppController {
    public function edit($id = null) {
        $manufacturer = $this->ShopManufacturers->newEntity();
        if ($id != null) {
            $manufacturer = $this->ShopManufacturers->find()->contain([
                'ShopManufacturerLocales'
            ])->where([
                'id' => $id
            ])->first();
        }

        if ($this->request->is('post') || $this->request->is('put')) {
            $manufacturer = $this->ShopManufacturers->patchEntity($manufacturer, $this->request->data());
            $result = $this->ShopManufacturers->save($manufacturer);
        }
    }
}
```

ShopManufacturersTable

``` php
class ShopManufacturersTable extends AppTable {
    public function initialize(array $config) {
        $this->hasMany('Shop.ShopManufacturerLocales', [
            'dependent'        => true,
            'cascadeCallbacks' => true
        ]);
    }
```

ShopManufacturerLocalesTable

``` php
class ShopManufacturerLocalesTable extends AppTable {
    public function initialize(array $config) {
        $this->belongsTo('Shop.ShopManufacturers');
    }
}
```

The main problem is, it worked/works in 3.2.14, but not in 3.3.0.

